'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is free [[DLC]] for ''[[Helldivers 2]]'', containing a [[medium armor]] set.

==Acquisition==
The set was initially only claimable via a finite [https://twitch.tv/drops Twitch Drop] between February 8th - 23rd, 2024.<br>
On December 12th, 2024, it was made available to [https://store.steampowered.com/app/2765950 Steam] users, in partnership with [https://thegameawards.com The Game Awards.]<ref>{{cite web|url=https://steamcommunity.com/games/553850/announcements/detail/603016424736161844|title=HELLDIVERS™ 2 &#124; Steam|date=2024-12-12|quote=Visit the Game Awards on Steam to unlock the TR-117 Alpha Commander armor early!}}</ref><br>
On December 19th, 2024, it was made available to [[Helldiver]]s across all platforms.

==Passive Ability==
{{Armor Passive Info Panel|Med-Kit}}

==Trivia==
*The familiar military green with metallic black accents and the number “117” allude to John-117 and his MJOLNIR armor from the [https://halowaypoint.com ''Halo''] series. Moreover, both “Alpha” and “Commander” are synonymous with his [[rank]], Master Chief.
*The armor set is primarily a [[CM-14 Physician]] reskin, with the exception that the left shoulder canisters are replaced by a second shoulder pad.

